  "title": "Easy Drop Cookies",
  "description": "My mother made these all year round; she simply changed the color of the sugar they were dipped in. Mix a small amount of powdered drink mix (such as Kool-Aid) into white sugar to create different colors and add a hint of flavor (do not omit the sugar, or the flavor will be too strong).",
